  "notes": "Images 1 and 2 are the same Waveshare pinout with printed pin numbers 1-18 (left column 1-9 down, right column 10-18 up); category-only tags (UART1, PWM, TWAI, I2S, ADC, I2C, SPI) omitted; the separate legend 'WS2812 RGB LED used pins GP10 DIN' is not tied to a pad and is noted here only. Image 3 is a third-party (mischianti.org) pinout titled 'Waveshare ESP32-C3 ZERO'; GPIO names printed as GPIO00...GPIO021, 'BULTIN LED' typo kept as printed, and the category tag 'JTAG' beside GPIO010 omitted. Note the sources disagree on UART0 direction: images 1-2 print GP20=UART0 RX, GP21=UART0 TX, image 3 prints GPIO020=TXD 0, GPIO021=RXD 0; each recorded as printed. Unlabeled bottom pads are skipped."
